---------------------------------------------------------------------------
External dependencies and assets (not bundled, except where noted)

- Hive blockchain public API nodes (api.hive.blog, api.deathwing.me, anyx.io,
  api.openhive.network): read-only JSON-RPC. Not bundled.
- images.hive.blog: avatar images fetched at runtime. Not bundled.
- CoinGecko public API: optional fallback price. Not bundled.
- libnotify (notify-send): desktop notifications. Not bundled; installed
  separately on the user's system.
- Omarchy shell / Quickshell / Qt: the host this plugin runs inside.
- assets/hive-logo.png: the Hive logo, bundled (resized copy). Hive brand
  asset; not covered by the MIT license above.
